# ── Local test/validation Unity project (M0 게이트용, 패키지 산출물 아님) ──
# `~` 접미사로 UPM 패키지 스캔에서도 무시됨(Samples~/Templates~ 와 동일). 여기선 git 추적도 제외.
/TestProject~/

# ── Build outputs, not source ──
*.csproj
*.sln
Library/
Temp/
obj/
Logs/
UserSettings/
*.unitypackage
.DS_Store

# ── UPM "~"-suffixed folders ──
# A common global core.excludesfile pattern ("*~", for editor backup files) also
# matches these package folders. Re-include them so the repo is self-contained
# and clones correctly regardless of the cloner's global git config.
!Samples~/
!Templates~/
!Documentation~/
!Exec~/
!Exec~/**
!Tools~/
!Tools~/**
!Skills~/
!Skills~/**
